xfce-md-viewer (0.1.0-1) noble; urgency=low

  * Initial scaffold: GTK4 application window, packaging and CI.
  * Rendering core: GFM, CommonMark, original Markdown and PHP Markdown Extra
    built in; Pandoc, MultiMarkdown and R Markdown via optional pandoc.
  * Pygments syntax highlighting; GitHub (auto/light/dark, from
    github-markdown-css 5.9.0) and Plain styles; user styles.
  * Content security policy blocks scripts and network access in documents.
  * Viewer window: background loading/rendering, auto-reload on file change
    (keeps scroll position), local .md links open in-window with back/forward,
    external links open in the default app, find bar, zoom (saved), print /
    PDF export, drag-and-drop, Open Recent, trimmed context menu.

 -- Tecktron Studios <software@tecktron.net>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
